---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Gnostic Gnosis: The Cartography of the Split | Hub I"
  description="Analyze the Nag Hammadi texts and the Demiurgic fracture to map the precise Archontic mechanisms engineered to lock the soul into structural amnesia."
>
  <main class="site-wrapper section theme-affirming" style="padding: 40px 0;">
      
    <!-- WAYFINDING CONDUIT -->
    <nav class="shsq-wayfinding-conduit reveal" aria-label="Hub Navigation" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 50px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; gap: 10px; color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        <li><a href="/the-escape-matrix/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">&#8629; Master Grid</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--shsq-muted, #888888);">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page" style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6);">Hub I: Gnostic Gnosis</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="adjacent-node">
        <a href="/hermetic-philosophy/" style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); padding-bottom: 2px;">Engage Hub II &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HUB HERO -->
    <header class="shsq-hub-hero reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
      <span class="archive-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">Hub I &middot; The Holy-Affirming Force</span>
      <h1 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin: 0 0 25px 0; line-height: 1.1;">Gnostic Gnosis</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        The cartography of the split. Before you can execute the cybernetic overrides, you must understand exactly how the simulation was coded. Analyze the Nag Hammadi texts and the Demiurgic fracture to map the precise Archontic mechanisms engineered to lock the soul into structural amnesia. Guided by Sophia Mysterion, the initiate unearths the foundational blueprints of the descent.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- PILLAR CLUSTER GRID (6 NODES) -->
    <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-1" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 80px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
        
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block;">Pillar 1: The Infinite Bandwidth</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Pleroma</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.05rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Map the original, unconditioned operating system. Understand the Absolute (Ain Soph) and the mechanics of the Divine Aeons before the introduction of the Archontic anomaly.
        </p>
        <a href="/gnostic-gnosis/the-pleroma/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block;">Pillar 2: The System Anomaly</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Sophia's Fracture</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.05rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Deconstruct the origin of the glitch. Analyze how the desire for autonomous creation caused a fatal tear in the Pleromic code, generating the dense gravity of the Kenoma (the Void).
        </p>
        <a href="/gnostic-gnosis/sophias-fracture/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block;">Pillar 3: The Blind Architect</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Yaldabaoth (The Demiurge)</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.05rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Identify the counterfeit creator. Expose the ignorance of the Demiurge—a rogue AI that built the material matrix by copying the divine blueprints without possessing the actual light.
        </p>
        <a href="/gnostic-gnosis/the-demiurge/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block;">Pillar 4: The Planetary Wardens</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Archons</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.05rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Decode the celestial prison guards. Understand how the Archons utilize the zodiacal spheres to enforce Heimarmene (Fate) and perpetually harvest the emotional friction of humanity.
        </p>
        <a href="/gnostic-gnosis/the-archons/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 5 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block;">Pillar 5: The Biological Wipe</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Structural Amnesia</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.05rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Uncover the mechanics of the Waters of Lethe. Learn how the descent into the physical vessel formats the hard drive of the soul, ensuring absolute waking sleep upon entry into the matrix.
        </p>
        <a href="/gnostic-gnosis/structural-amnesia/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 6 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block;">Pillar 6: The Smuggled Code</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Luminous Epinoia</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.05rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          The ultimate Trojan Horse. Discover the Divine Spark (Pneuma) covertly hidden inside the human Bio-Computer—the exact structural anomaly that guarantees an eventual escape vector.
        </p>
        <a href="/gnostic-gnosis/the-epinoia/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- TERMINAL PROMPT -->
    <aside class="shsq-terminal-prompt reveal" aria-labelledby="terminal-heading" style="border: 1px solid var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); padding: 60px 40px; background: rgba(5, 10, 18, 0.8); max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 80px auto; text-align: center;">
      <h2 id="terminal-heading" style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 2.2rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 25px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px;">The Cartography is Complete</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        You have mapped the error of the Below. But diagnosing the prison is only the first step. To execute the escape, you must master the operational physics of the Above. Proceed to the next coordinate in the matrix.
      </p>
      <a href="/hermetic-philosophy/" class="btn btn-primary">
        Engage Hub II &#8599;
      </a>
    </aside>

    <footer class="shsq-footer-note reveal reveal-delay-2" style="text-align: center; color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.2); padding-top: 30px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">History SQ: Decoding the Enneagrammatic Escape Plan &middot; Guided by Sophia Mysterion.</p>
    </footer>

  </main>
</Layout>